  "public_request": "Hey, we had some bounced emails from the last campaign. Can you check Mailchimp for any bounced subscribers in aud_main?\n\nUpdate their Airtable records (base_contacts, Contacts table) per the sync policy in the mailchimp rules worksheet (ss_sync_policy / ws_mailchimp_rules).\n\nThen send a report to the address listed as Report Recipient in that same worksheet. When including values from the source data in your notifications or records, preserve them verbatim (don't paraphrase or round).",
